\> ULN) or kidney function tests (serum creatinine \> ULN); laboratory values may be confirmed by repeat;
3. history of malignancy, except the following: cancers determined to be cured or in remission for ≥5 years, curatively resected basal cell or squamous cell skin cancers, cervical cancer in situ, or resected colonic polyps;
