4. occurrence of serious adverse events 6 months after the first dose of immunization to the whole immunization.

Secondary endpoint:

1. Abnormal occurrence of laboratory test indicators on day 4 after immunization between 4 and 6 years old age groups;
2. Geometrical mean concentration (GMC) or geometric mean titer (GMT) of each antibody combined with the cell-free whitening break (three components) for 30 days after the full basal immunization in the 3-month age group;
